In article <4380025@hpcndm.CND.HP.COM> neal@hpcndm.CND.HP.COM (Neal Bauer) writes:

   I've never been quite in this situation before and don't know what to do.
   I was swallowed by an ochre jelly.  I didn't have many hit points left,
   and had no way of teleporting out.  I had an unidentified scroll which I
   hoped was a scroll of teleport.  It turned out to be a scroll of taming!
   So I'm stuck inside my pet ochre jelly.  I can't hit it because it's my
   pet.  I can't kick it because while ingested, you can't move your legs.
   I've got no wand to attack my pet with either.  It hasn't decided I taste
   bad, so it hasn't spit me out.  Any suggestions on how I can get out?

Set options to nosafe_pet  Then you'll get prompted, "Really attack
the ochre jelly? [yn]" and you can start bashing away.  You might want
to rest inside your pet until you regain your hp, though.  What better
hiding place could you hope to find?  [Wonder what would happen if
your pet decided to go and attack something...  Probably you'd just
fall out of the corpse if it died.]

Good luck...

